culuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTyMSMaonnrIpxvzpDG29019PNFjh8oIdr8gLqIcw5tgg&oe=6AFDDC36"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Project Shadows", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Project Shadows is an immersive and thrilling gorilla tag-inspired multiplayer game where players leap, climb, and swing through a mysterious shadowy environment. Set in a world cloaked in perpetual twilight, the game combines fast-paced movement mechanics with a hauntingly beautiful atmosphere, encouraging both competitive gameplay and exploration.\n\nKey Features:\nFluid Parkour Movement: Run, jump, and climb seamlessly as you navigate intricate environments full of hidden paths and secret areas.\nDynamic Shadow World: Explore a unique setting where dark forests, abandoned ruins, and glowing caves create a visually stunning yet eerie landscape.\nStrategic Gameplay: Evade enemies, chase down opponents, and outsmart your friends in a variety of game modes like tag, hide-and-seek, and capture the orb.\nCustomizable Characters: Personalize your shadow creature with unique skins, glowing patterns, and accessories that match your style.\nSocial Multiplayer Experience: Join friends or meet new players in vibrant lobbies with proximity chat and cooperative mini-games.\nProject Shadows combines the physical challenge of tag with a dark and enigmatic world where every movement counts, every shadow hides a secret, and every game tells a new story. Can you master the shadows?", "short_description": "Project Shadows is an immersive and thrilling gorilla tag-inspired multiplayer game where players leap, climb, and swing through a mysterious shadowy environment. Set in a world cloaked in perpetual twilight, the game combines fast-paced movement mechanics with a hauntingly beautiful atmosphere, encouraging both competitive gameplay and exploration.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/project-shadows/", "